(7762851, 1286482, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The pencil looks ever so slightly out of focus to me, though. Like maybe the camera shook a little. And it''s not quite straight, and I can''t tell if that''s intentional since it''s just a little off vertical. I tend to expect either straight or obviously angled.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The pencil looks ever so slightly out of focus to me, though. Like maybe the camera shook a little. And it''s not quite straight, and I can''t tell if that''s intentional since it''s just a little off vertical. I tend to expect either straight or obviously angled.', '2024-01-31 07:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7762852, 1286479, 141319, '<td valign="top">Indeed - show stopper. Awesome image</td>', 'Indeed - show stopper. Awesome image', '2024-01-31 07:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
