(7763355, 1286428, 173844, '<td valign="top">Curled up dead leaves are often compellingly beautiful.  In their seemingly random disposition, calligraphic innovation, and subtle colors, they seem to have shed their summer for a new life.  The background colors echo their recent past out of which is distilled a sharper elegance.  Effective depth of field.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Curled up dead leaves are often compellingly beautiful.  In their seemingly random disposition, calligraphic innovation, and subtle colors, they seem to have shed their summer for a new life.  The background colors echo their recent past out of which is distilled a sharper elegance.  Effective depth of field.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2024-02-06 22:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763356, 1286479, 173844, '<td valign="top">When I first opened this photo I drew back, startled by his stand-out closeness.  He''s impeccable in front of a more usual street scene. And this street scene is even more interesting with it''s dissolution into smoke (or steam or fog, etc.) and glare.  Excellent craftsmanship.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'When I first opened this photo I drew back, startled by his stand-out closeness.  He''s impeccable in front of a more usual street scene. And this street scene is even more interesting with it''s dissolution into smoke (or steam or fog, etc.) and glare.  Excellent craftsmanship.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2024-02-06 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763357, 1286463, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a terrific, creative idea to so cunningly express your happiness through a challenge entry.  Great depth of field, with the photo clear and precise, and the two of you blurred but not so much as to keep your faces and mood obscured.  Good fortune to you all.<br/>Personal third favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'What a terrific, creative idea to so cunningly express your happiness through a challenge entry.  Great depth of field, with the photo clear and precise, and the two of you blurred but not so much as to keep your faces and mood obscured.  Good fortune to you all.Personal third favorite of the challenge.', '2024-02-06 23:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763358, 1286510, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2024-02-06 23:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7763388, 1286463, 98565, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the idea -- but something seems off on this. It seems like the DOF was done in photoshop? It just looks like such a sharp fall off at the knuckles on the hand. I''m sorry if it''s not the case, but something just looks wrong on this. 6 for the idea. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you Wendy for your time to validate this and your kind words.<br/> <br/>No, no photoshop.<br/>It was takaen with my Fuji Camera and my fixed focal length 50mm at f1.4<br/>It needed a little bit pp because of the white balance and cropping, but I actually didn''t change the DOF</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: I like the idea -- but something seems off on this. It seems like the DOF was done in photoshop? It just looks like such a sharp fall off at the knuckles on the hand. I''m sorry if it''s not the case, but something just looks wrong on this. 6 for the idea.   Thank you Wendy for your time to validate this and your kind words. No, no photoshop.It was takaen with my Fuji Camera and my fixed focal length 50mm at f1.4It needed a little bit pp because of the white balance and cropping, but I actually didn''t change the DOF', '2024-02-07 01:57:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7763392, 1286479, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by grahamgator:</b></div><hr/><i> This looks like a nicely done wedding photo.   One of my top picks. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks - not a wedding shoot but a successful guy wanting some new photos for social media etc.</td>', 'Originally posted by grahamgator: This looks like a nicely done wedding photo.   One of my top picks.   Thanks - not a wedding shoot but a successful guy wanting some new photos for social media etc.', '2024-02-07 03:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
